  (201, 32, 1, 'product', 174, '330126', 'HYDROSTATIC RELEASE UNIT, HAMMER H20 E FOR EPIRB  These units consist of a double looped rope line, a release mechanism, and a weak link.  This release unit conforms with the requirements of the 1983 amendments to SOLAS 1974.  These units will release the liferaft or EPIRB (Emergency Position Indicating Radio Beacon) at a depth of between 1.5 and 4 mtrs underwater.  The units could be round or square shape.  Below is a reference of brand & manufacturers, but there are specific types of HRU for certain EPIRB brand.  Please specify the types and brand when ordering.', 174, 151, 1.0, 19, 2750000.00, 1950000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
