  (701, 136, 8, 'product', 405, '311016', 'GOGGLE VALUTE FOR CHEMICAL &, METAL SPLASH
REQUEST MSA VAULT SAFETY GOOGLE BLACK AND GREY', 405, 454, 25.0, 21, 50000.00, 35000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (702, 137, 1, 'product', 540, '613056', 'PUNCHING TOOL SET DIES & TABLE, 6-38MM 16''S  Used for punching holes in soft brass, copper, and other soft metals as well as leather, canvas, and gasketing materials. A set for 6 to 38 mm is available as standard, size 40 to 55 mm are available on request and make to order.', 540, 455, 1.0, 19, 2000000.00, 1300000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (703, 137, 2, 'product', 541, '614196', 'BLUE PASTE 120GRM  For lapping of bearings, high pressure valves, etc.  Improved type on red lead for prevision lapping work.  A jelly-like paste made of super corpuscular dyes furnished in tubes.', 541, 456, 10.0, 35, 145000.00, 95000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (704, 137, 3, 'product', 542, '614202', 'CARBORUNDUM PASTE GRIT#2000, MICRO FINE 450GRM  For precision lapping, fitting, surfacing, polishing and other general use in machine shops.  Universally used for grinding valves.  Supplied in 450 grm tin.  Please specify grit number when ordering.', 542, 457, 1.0, 34, 68000.00, 46800.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (705, 137, 4, 'product', 543, '614203', 'CARBORUNDUM PASTE GRIT#1500, MICRO FINE 450GRM  For precision lapping, fitting, surfacing, polishing and other general use in machine shops.  Universally used for grinding valves.  Supplied in 450 grm tin.  Please specify grit number when ordering.', 543, 458, 1.0, 34, 68000.00, 46800.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (706, 137, 5, 'product', 544, '614206', 'CARBORUNDUM PASTE GRIT#800, MICRO FINE 450GRM  For precision lapping, fitting, surfacing, polishing and other general use in machine shops.  Universally used for grinding valves.  Supplied in 450 grm tin.  Please specify grit number when ordering.', 544, 459, 1.0, 34, 68000.00, 46800.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (707, 137, 6, 'product', 545, '614208', 'CARBORUNDUM PASTE GRIT#500, VERY FINE 450GRM  For precision lapping, fitting, surfacing, polishing and other general use in machine shops.  Universally used for grinding valves.  Supplied in 450 grm tin.  Please specify grit number when ordering.', 545, 460, 1.0, 34, 68000.00, 46800.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (708, 137, 7, 'product', 546, '615071', 'PULLER GEAR & WHEEL 3-ARM, 0-200MM  Drop forged from vanadium steel.  This rigid 3 arm puller has been designed for situations where the use of a 2 arm puller is not possible.', 546, 461, 1.0, 19, 750000.00, 500000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (709, 137, 8, 'product', 547, '615070', 'PULLER GEAR & WHEEL 3-ARM, 0-125MM  Drop forged from vanadium steel.  This rigid 3 arm puller has been designed for situations where the use of a 2 arm puller is not possible.', 547, 462, 1.0, 19, 445000.00, 275000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (710, 137, 9, 'product', 548, '615239', 'RIVET BLIND OPENTYPE ALUM-BODY, STEEL-MANDREL 3.2X8.0MM 60''S  High strength, precision-made hollow rivets assembled on a solid mandrel.  They are specially useful for “blind” fastening where no access to the reverse side is available.  Rivets are made in various sizes with head styles in aluminium, steel, monel, copper and stainless steel.  Two types of standard rivets, open and closed, are available but the most common open type is described below.  Standard Open Type:  Standard open type rivet is a hollow rivet, pre-assembled on to a headed pin or mandrel.  The mandrel is designed to fracture at a pre-determined point during the setting operation, when the lamination forming the structure being fastened, have been drawn closely  together  and  the  whole join is tight.  Normally on the vessel the rivet of aluminium alloy body and steel mandrel are used.  Unless otherwise specified the aluminium alloy body and steel mandrel type will be supplied.  Please specify diameter and length in mm when ordering.', 548, 463, 1.0, 36, 185000.00, 115000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (711, 137, 10, 'product', 549, '615238', 'RIVET BLIND OPENTYPE ALUM-BODY, STEEL-MANDREL 3.2X6.3MM 60''S  High strength, precision-made hollow rivets assembled on a solid mandrel.  They are specially useful for “blind” fastening where no access to the reverse side is available.  Rivets are made in various sizes with head styles in aluminium, steel, monel, copper and stainless steel.  Two types of standard rivets, open and closed, are available but the most common open type is described below.  Standard Open Type:  Standard open type rivet is a hollow rivet, pre-assembled on to a headed pin or mandrel.  The mandrel is designed to fracture at a pre-determined point during the setting operation, when the lamination forming the structure being fastened, have been drawn closely  together  and  the  whole join is tight.  Normally on the vessel the rivet of aluminium alloy body and steel mandrel are used.  Unless otherwise specified the aluminium alloy body and steel mandrel type will be supplied.  Please specify diameter and length in mm when ordering.', 549, 464, 1.0, 36, 215000.00, 150000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (712, 137, 11, 'product', 258, '615237', 'RIVET BLIND OPENTYPE ALUM-BODY, STEEL-MANDREL 3.2X4.4MM 60''S  High strength, precision-made hollow rivets assembled on a solid mandrel.  They are specially useful for “blind” fastening where no access to the reverse side is available.  Rivets are made in various sizes with head styles in aluminium, steel, monel, copper and stainless steel.  Two types of standard rivets, open and closed, are available but the most common open type is described below.  Standard Open Type:  Standard open type rivet is a hollow rivet, pre-assembled on to a headed pin or mandrel.  The mandrel is designed to fracture at a pre-determined point during the setting operation, when the lamination forming the structure being fastened, have been drawn closely  together  and  the  whole join is tight.  Normally on the vessel the rivet of aluminium alloy body and steel mandrel are used.  Unless otherwise specified the aluminium alloy body and steel mandrel type will be supplied.  Please specify diameter and length in mm when ordering.', 258, NULL, 1.0, 36, 0.00, NULL, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (713, 137, 12, 'product', 550, '616490', 'WRENCH HOOK SPANNER 68-75MM, STAINLESS STEEL', 550, 465, 3.0, 21, 535000.00, 375000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (714, 137, 13, 'product', 551, '616822', 'PLIER SIDE CUTTING STAINLESS, STEEL 175MM', 551, 466, 3.0, 21, 100000.00, 67000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (715, 137, 14, 'product', 552, '616829', 'PLIER LONG-NOSE SIDE CUTTING, STAINLESS STEEL 200MM  An ideal tool for quick repair and electronic works.', 552, 467, 2.0, 21, 115000.00, 78000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (716, 137, 15, 'product', 553, '616469', 'WRENCH ADJUSTABLE STAINLESS, STEEL 250MM', 553, 468, 2.0, 21, 210000.00, 127000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (717, 137, 16, 'product', 554, '616467', 'WRENCH ADJUSTABLE STAINLESS, STEEL 150MM', 554, 469, 2.0, 21, 110000.00, 74000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (718, 137, 17, 'product', 555, '510135', 'BRUSH PAINT ROUND 19MM DIAM  A natural, black bristle brush sealed in rubber and bound with a metal band.', 555, 470, 3.0, 21, 38000.00, 22000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (719, 137, 18, 'product', 556, '510202', 'BRUSH SASH TOOL OVAL 21MM  A small paint brush used on window frames or in places where a large brush can not be used conveniently.    Black bristle, chisel trim, metal binding and varnished handle.  When ordering, please specify the brush diameter in mm, as number sizes differ by country.', 556, 471, 3.0, 21, 40000.00, 25000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (720, 137, 19, 'product', 557, '510201', 'BRUSH SASH TOOL OVAL 15MM  A small paint brush used on window frames or in places where a large brush can not be used conveniently.    Black bristle, chisel trim, metal binding and varnished handle.  When ordering, please specify the brush diameter in mm, as number sizes differ by country.', 557, 472, 3.0, 21, 35000.00, 20000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (721, 137, 20, 'product', 558, '510662', 'BRUSH WIRE STRAIGHT HANDLE, 270MM  Strong wire brush for cleaning paint brushes, polishing ferrous material, or removing rust, sludge and debris on deck, or in the engine room.', 558, 473, 5.0, 21, 35000.00, 20000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (722, 137, 21, 'product', 559, '510771', 'BRUSH WIRE WHEEL STANDARD, 75MMX3/8"  Designed for high speed operation on pneumatic or electric scaling and sanding machines.  These brushes remove rust and scale from metal, clean tanks and boat hulls, take off old paint, and clean castings and structural metal.  Threaded nut type and welded shaft types are available.  When ordering, please specify the type of fitting required on the cup brush and the inner diameter of the bolt fitting.  – Caution –  Whenever ordering wire brushes, be certain that they will not be used on machines with speeds higher than the maximum safety speed shown for the brush.', 559, 474, 10.0, 21, 60000.00, 45000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
