  (944, 149, 1, 'product', 751, '233843', 'SHACKLE STRAIGHT EYE BOLT, GALV JIS-M-SD 22MM SWL 2.0TON  A drop forged, carbon steel shackle with an eye bolt which has metric coarse threads at one end.  Please specify Ungalvanized (Black) or Galvanized shackles is required.  Galvanized.  Size: Body dia: 22mm, Opening: 44mm, Screw Pin Thread: M27, Clear Length: 74mm, Pin dia: 27mm, S.W.L: 2ton.', 751, 651, 10.0, 21, 75000.00, 42000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (945, 149, 2, 'product', 752, '614856', 'WHEEL CUT-OFF RESINOID GRAIN36, 100X2.0X9.53MM 4300MTR/MIN  These resin bond cutting wheels have a big advantage over rubber cut-off wheels.  They resist very high cutting heats, have an aggressive cutting action, and a longer disc life.  Grain No. 36 (medium grain) is recommended for general purpose ships use.', 752, 652, 72.0, 21, 20000.00, 14000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
