  (950, 149, 7, 'product', 756, '174275', 'SPRING CLAMP MOP COMPLETE  Quick-way type spring clamp eliminates cutting or untangling.  Merely slide off the old mop head and slide on the new one, takes just seconds.', 756, 656, 24.0, 21, 170000.00, 120000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (951, 149, 8, 'product', 110, '510462', 'SPARE MINI ROLLER 100MM WIDTH  Small sized rollers designed for painting radiators, trim or other narrow surfaces.  Acryl & Polyester Type and Microfibre type are available.', 110, 657, 200.0, 21, 5000.00, 2000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (952, 149, 9, 'product', 757, '612612', 'HAMMER CHIPPING WITH HANDLE, 450GRM  Designed for removing boiler, scale, rust or paint on vessels, etc.  Forged from a special grade of steel.  Handle made of hard wood.', 757, 658, 36.0, 21, 90000.00, 58000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (953, 149, 10, 'product', 758, '613686', 'SHOVEL STEEL SQUARE 1050MM  Blade is forged in one piece from a solid bar of special treated steel for heavy duty work.', 758, 659, 6.0, 21, 120000.00, 70000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (954, 149, 11, 'product', 759, '794397', 'CABLE REEL EXTENSION AC220V, 50MTR  Portable reels which are suitable for use in a work place which is separated from an electrical power source.  Available for use with cord lengths from 20 mtrs to 50 mtrs.  Contains built in outlets that provide power connections for tools and equipment.   When ordering, please specify the required cord length, voltage, ampere, type of plug and receptacle currently in use so that reel can be used properly with your equipment.', 759, 660, 1.0, 19, 1350000.00, 825000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (955, 149, 12, 'product', 401, '851547', 'GAS SPAN 2.5% VOL (50%LEL), METHANE BALANCE AIR 20LTR  Span Gas for all types of gas detectors and analyzer.  To help comply with standards, various types of calibration gas cylinders are available for your usage.  The most important accessory to any gas detector is a calibration kit, which provides the means to determine if the instrument is working properly.  When using gas detection equipment, it is necessary to calibrate the equipment on a regular basis to guarantee accurate results.  According to some regulations and standards, one must test the gas detector prior to each use with a suitable test gas.  Type of Mixture Gases:  A span gas comes in aluminum alloy cylinder.   Please specify kind of gas with capacity of cylinder you request selecting from standard ranges in the following table.  If other Mixtures are required, please specify Gas Type and Concentration.', 401, 661, 1.0, 34, 11000000.00, 7000000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (956, 149, 13, 'product', 760, '851056', 'EARTH CLAMP W/WELDING CABLE, EL200+SKM25-9MM 25MM2 L:5MTR   A spring type earth clamp connected with welding cable.   Welding cable neoprene HO-1/N2-D.', 760, 662, 1.0, 21, 145000.00, 90000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (957, 149, 14, 'product', 761, '110550', 'SUNGLASSES PLASTIC FRAME  Various types of sunglasses are available.  When ordering, please specify the material, frame shape and lens colour.', 761, 663, 10.0, 38, 32000.00, 15000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (958, 149, 15, 'product', 762, '174188', 'PLASTIC BAG W/SELF FASTENER, 280X400MM 100''S  Ordinary transparent plastic bag with fastener which can be easily sealed by sliding over the bag opening between thumb and forefinger.  Helps prevent the articles inside from becoming damp and dusty.', 762, 664, 200.0, 36, 5000.00, 1500.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (959, 149, 16, 'product', 763, '174280', 'WRINGER MOP BUCKET PLASTIC, 330X340X280MM  A handy foot pedal device to wring out the mop without bending over.  The size is 330 x 340 x 280 mm made of hard plastic or galvanized steel with a steel wringer frame.  For preventing cross contamination of different areas, various colours are available for sanitary management.', 763, 665, 6.0, 21, 550000.00, 325000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (960, 149, 17, 'product', 534, '190101', 'GLOVES WORKING COTTON ORDINARY  Woven from cotton thread and machine knitted, fitting smooth to the hands.  One size fits all.', 534, 666, 120.0, 17, 45000.00, 31000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (961, 149, 18, 'product', 764, '232363', 'RAT GUARD 600MM, FOR 73MM ROPE DIA  Fitted closely on hawsers and lines to prevent rats from boarding the ship.  Conforms with all quarantine regulations.', 764, 667, 12.0, 21, 275000.00, 150000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (962, 149, 19, 'product', 569, '232907', 'RAG COTTON OVER 100% STERILIZED, WHITE  Available in white, light-colour or coloured type rags.  All material has been thoroughly washed and sterilized.  One bundle contains five 4-kg packets.  Sold by kg.', 569, 581, 300.0, 3, 25000.00, 14000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
